# Pairs with RAllOrNothing. A tree added back after a decommission bootstraps
# before the peer has applied the sibling records written before it was added:
# the origin purged the sub-saga while the tree was removed, so the import carries
# bare committed rows and no barrier holds the sibling's tally yet.
MODULE: RAllOrNothingFreshReaddNoBoundary
TARGET: RAllOrNothing
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a tree added back to the peer is imported before the peer has applied its siblings' earlier records
PERTURBS: ReaddFresh
BOUNDS: LossPath = 4, JoinStart = 0, SagaOutcome = 0, Shape = 1, PreHold = 0, DialFaults = 0

--- FIND
    /\ ubnd' = ubnd \cup {r \in outbox : ~Aff(r)}
    /\ UNCHANGED <<originVars, xtree, oext, orcv, outbox, dlv, cdec, rfin, rtodo,
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no boundary at the re-add.
    /\ ubnd' = ubnd
    /\ UNCHANGED <<originVars, xtree, oext, orcv, outbox, dlv, cdec, rfin, rtodo,
--- END
